<title>USA: Mercantile Bankshares Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Mercantile Bankshares Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BALTIMORE 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.67		    $0.58</p>
<p> Net			 32,014		   27,733</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	47,445		   47,956</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>Note: For Q1 ended March 31, 1997, net interest income increased by seven percent over 1996 to $80,221,000 due to an increase of 4.5 percent in average earning assets and an increase of 3.1 percent or 16 basis points in net interest margin on earning assets.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
